{"strings":["AIP","Details related to the Additional Information Package (AIP) to be used for exchange of response or intergovernmental information, if needed in combination with Base Information Package (BIP) Declaration or LPCO.","Functional identifier","Identification of a specific information exchange.","Document reference number, assigned by the Trader","Additional information package type code","Code specifying the type of additional information package (Response, InterGov).","AIPTypeCodeList","AdditionalInformation","Details related to the special request from declarant to government to take or not to take action.","In case of using Additional statement code, text or indicator you can make the information more specific by also using Additional statement type.\nIf there are more than 1 occurrences you should always use it in combination with the type.","Additional statement code","Code specifying the form of an additional statement.","User code list","Additional statement description","Description of an additional statement.","Additional statement type code","Code specifying the subject of the additional statement.","StatementTypeCodeList","AEOProgramProfile","Details related to the Authorized Economic Operator (AEO) program.","Country code","Code specifying the name of the country or other geographical entity as specified in ISO 3166 and UN/ECE Rec 3.","CountryCodeList","Agency name","Name of the agency responsible for the country’s Authorized Economic Operator (AEO) program.","AEO program name","Name of the country’s Authorized Economic Operator (AEO) program.","Number of AEO members","Quantity specifying the number of members in a country’s Authorized Economic Operator (AEO) program.","AEO program established year","Year of establishment of the Authorized Economic Operator (AEO) program.","AEO program type code","Code of the Authorized Economic Operator (AEO) program basis type (e.g. Security, Compliance)","AEOProgramTypeCodeList","Communication","Details r